# 14. Prediction Endpoint

The FastAPI application exposes a prediction endpoint:

```text
POST /predict
```

A client sends the required model features as JSON.

The application:

1. Receives the HTTP request.
2. Validates the input using Pydantic.
3. Passes the validated input to the prediction function.
4. Performs model inference.
5. Returns the prediction as a JSON response.

The public request therefore becomes:

```text
Client
   │
   │ POST /predict
   ▼
ALB :80
   │
   ▼
ECS :8000
   │
   ▼
FastAPI /predict
   │
   ▼
ML inference
   │
   ▼
JSON prediction
```

